{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_bison_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_bison_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "充實的假期",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_bison_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c00a5b8881f52273765602d10c969f0fb1d4b773fd98a15be8f737844d29e563",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "巴特勒，明天就要放年假了，還是早點回家休息吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "沒關係，少爺，就剩最後一點事情了，馬上就能做完。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "少爺，這麼晚了您怎麼還不睡？加了這麼多天班，您也應該趁此機會好好休息一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "本來是這麼打算的......但是......父親他近來想要擴展在哥倫比亞的業務。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "我想......自己也應該提前做些什麼，配合父親的腳步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "少爺，我記得老爺他只是在飯桌上提了這麼一句而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "如果等他正式告知我再做，基本上，也就沒有我能出力的地方了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "......唉，少爺辛苦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "為了能在將來接過父親身上的擔子，再怎麼辛苦也不為過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歐厄爾",
      "text": "這麼晚了，拜松，你在和巴特勒聊什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "沒什麼，父親，我們在聊假期計劃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "老爺，請問您對少爺的假期計劃知情嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歐厄爾",
      "text": "我並不知情，這小子最近忙得我也見不到幾面。所以你有什麼想法嗎，拜松？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "呃......我想學點新東西，或者為明年要做的專案做準備，我還沒想清楚，但總歸是要找些事情做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歐厄爾",
      "text": "這可是假期啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歐厄爾",
      "text": "......拜松，如果非要找事情做的話，去見見你在企鵝物流的朋友吧。我從哥倫比亞帶了很多東西回來，你可以挑幾樣作為禮物送過去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "好，沒問題，父親。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歐厄爾",
      "text": "行了，早點休息吧，拜松。明天起早點，沒有巴特勒幫忙，你得自己準備禮物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "嗯，我自己一個人可以的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "我可以留下來為少爺打包好禮物再走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "不不不，你還是按時回家陪陪家人吧，巴特勒。辛苦一年，這是你難得的休假，不用為我加班了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "何況......我想父親的本意肯定不是讓我單純地拜訪朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "和企鵝物流的朋友相處久了，偶爾也會忘記，他們其實是我們的合作對象。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "父親應該就是在指點我，一段合作關係需要長時間的持續維護，不能因為已經熟稔，就不去在意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "巴特勒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "啊，沒什麼，我就是突然有些懷念夫人還在家的時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "能天使，我們只是出門野餐，你為什麼要帶這麼多把銃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "因為我們永遠不知道下一秒來的是奶油三明治，還是突發事件。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "呃，好重......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "可頌，你為什麼帶了那麼多食物，我們只是去野餐，吃不了那麼多的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不......今天天氣很好，去野餐的人一定很多。\n我......可不能......錯過......商機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "德克薩斯，你就不說點什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "哦，我勸過了，她不聽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不必多說了，只要能夠大賺一筆，\n這點、重量、算呃......什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "（老天爺啊......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "嗯......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "拜松，你怎麼今天來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "叨擾了，新年快樂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "我帶了些禮物給你們，不知道合不合你們的心意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "哇，好漂亮的燈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "欸，拜松？嘿嘿，既然來了，想不想和我們一起去公園野餐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "哈，你只是想找個人幫你搬東西吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "咳咳，謝謝可頌姐的邀請，但我只是趁假期空閒過來打個招呼，稍微坐坐就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "可是，前段時間你一直在忙，我們好久都沒有見面了。是事情沒有做完要加班嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "其實，公司的事情已經處理妥當了，我只是不想因為假期就鬆懈下來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "可假期不就是一個應該好好放鬆的時期嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "對啊，對啊。我為這次野餐特意準備了好看的新墊子，一起來嘛，拜松！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "可是我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "您好，請問有什麼事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "什麼......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "好......雖然不理解，但是沒問題，我們接受......嗯，好的，再見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "誰來的電話？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "是老闆。情況有變，我們今天沒法去野餐了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "不要啊，難道是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "嗯，看來是突發事件先到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "雖然很可惜，但還是不得不宣佈，我們接到了一個緊急委託。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空&能天使&可頌",
      "text": "不————！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "湊過來，我有話要說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "什麼事啊？神神秘秘的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（看來她們的討論很激烈......我是不是該識趣點。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "那個，如果大家有事的話，我就不打擾了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "等一下，拜松。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "這個委託還會麻煩到你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "我......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "對，你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "事項一，來這家影音店買CD？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "這......不是應該交給空來做更為適合嗎？我對音樂又沒有什麼深入研究。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "老闆，你好，請問這裡有......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "噓......小聲點，大家都在聽歌呢。想聽什麼就去架子上拿，那裡什麼都有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "不能推薦推薦嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "一般情況下，來這裡的人都不會問這種話，你就隨便選一張吧，小朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "我成年了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "那挺好，那一片區域你也可以去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "那裡有什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......我知道了，不打擾了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "他戴上耳機了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊音",
      "text": "真的嗎？太好了，我就知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊音",
      "text": "這是我最喜歡的店了，老闆從來不會推銷和詢問，任你在他浩瀚的收藏中尋找自己心儀的唱片。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊音",
      "text": "有時候演出壓力過大，我就會來這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "聽起來是個讓人放鬆的好地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊音",
      "text": "相信我啦，他一定會在這裡徹底感受到放鬆的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "等等......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊音",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "他把耳機放下了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "老闆，你還好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "啊......看來我進購的CD實在是太多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "是我的話，就不會去碰那座岌岌可危的CD山，你到底堆多久了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "一年？兩年？太久了......我實在是懶得收拾了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "看來你需要一個人幫忙分揀這批CD。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "......是吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "原來如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（看來這就是我真正要做的事情了......真是的，也不把委託寫得更清楚一點。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（聽音樂......挺好，但不適合現在。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "老闆，請交給我做吧，我曾經做過分揀員，整理的貨物可比這些CD複雜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "小夥子你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "相信我，我是專業的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "啊......等等，你打算怎麼分類啊，小夥子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊音",
      "text": "發生什麼事情了？喂？喂？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......店裡的CD堆倒塌了，他在幫忙規整。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊音",
      "text": "那聽歌呢？他沒有在聽歌嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "看他那忙得熱火朝天的樣子，應該是顧不上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "唉......肩膀好酸，想不到老闆店裡的CD有那麼多，隨便買幾張也不知道夠不夠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "不過分揀工作的結果似乎還不錯，看來這麼長時間沒做，手也沒有變生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "讓我看看，下一項委託是......在這家武器店狠狠殺價？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "這是給我的委託？怎麼看都應該是給可頌姐的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊音",
      "text": "怎麼樣，他進去了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊音",
      "text": "嘿嘿，上次因為殺價太狠被這家店的老闆列入黑名單，再也不許我登門購物。但那又如何呢？我還有別的辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我想，那位委託人的目的並不是這個吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊音",
      "text": "哎呀，難道你不覺得狠狠殺價非常解壓嗎？費盡心思與老闆唇槍舌戰一番，最後捧走勝利的果實。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊音",
      "text": "相信我，他一定會因此而倍感輕鬆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "呵，希望如此，這樣工作就能早點結束了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "哎喲，小夥子，光顧小店是想買些什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "等等，我有一張購物單。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "嘿，嚯——這可不短啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "上面的東西各樣都來一份，打包後我帶走，麻煩了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "好的，帳單給您，一共十六萬，現金還是銀行卡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（這價格......用得著殺價嗎？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（......算了，畢竟是委託。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "老闆，能再便宜一些嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "小夥子，這話我就不愛聽了，我們店可是出了名的物美價廉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "那算了吧，我去別家看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "嘖，看你買了這麼多，給你打個九折好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（九折......算“狠狠”嗎？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "咳咳，小夥子，這已經是我的成本價了，不要太過分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（......或許可以用一些談判桌上的技巧，雖然還不成熟，但講個價應該足夠了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "老闆，做生意還是誠信一些吧，這遠遠不到你的底線。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "你個毛頭小子知道什麼？這些零件可都是來自哥倫比亞的進口貨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（搖頭）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "老闆，這些東西雖然貼了哥倫比亞的牌子，但是一看切割工藝留下的痕跡就能辨識出，它們其實是產自玻利瓦爾的代工工廠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "你賣給我的價格遠超貨物的成本價，我大致估算了下，這些東西最多不超過六萬龍門幣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "你在胡說些什麼，我這些當然是正品零件。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "你堅持？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "老闆，你進貨的時候可能被人騙了，這個牌子的貨物一直交由我家的運輸路線運送，不同批次、不同型號、不同廠商，我都一清二楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "不要輕信別人啊，老闆，這樣怎麼做生意？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "你說我傻？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "當然還有另一種可能，你不僅不傻，還很聰明，畢竟正品和低端貼牌代工貨的價格差別真的很大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "......你什麼意思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "一口價八萬，除去各項成本開銷，已經夠你賺很多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "太狠了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......你別哭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老闆",
      "text": "嗚......你太狠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "有人出來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊音",
      "text": "哈哈，是不是有人自信滿滿、意氣風發、昂首闊步，丟掉一身壓力，帶著滿滿的貨物離開了店。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不，是老闆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "老闆哭著跑出了店。",
