    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊音",
      "text": "......什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊音",
      "text": "要我說嘛，她們的計劃都太複雜了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊音",
      "text": "要放鬆舒緩壓力還不容易嗎？派對啊派對，直接加入派對狂歡難道不是最簡單的辦法嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你剛剛說什麼？這裡很吵，聽不到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊音",
      "text": "我說，讓他來參加派對是最直接的解壓方法！！",
