    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "您還好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿鎧甲的騎士",
      "text": "你到底是誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......很不幸，他找到你說的人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊音",
      "text": "怎麼可能？我不相信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "有一個卡西米爾的騎士在人群中。",
